msgctxt "56_Volcano Staff"
msgid "'Sup, Akiyama-san."
msgstr "Hola buenas, Akiyama-san."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "68_Akiyama"
msgid "'Sup yourself. Working hard, I see."
msgstr "Trabajando duro, ¿eh?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "80_Volcano Staff"
msgid "Aw, my girl keeps bugging me－wants to go on a trip. But I'm\\r\nworking five days a week this month. I don't even have time\\r\nfor college."
msgstr "Es que mi novia anda muy insistente con querer viajar.\nAcá me tiene trabajando horas extras. Ni siquiera tengo\ntiempo para la universidad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "Like you'd go if you had the time? Listen, I'm here to ask you a little favor. If you see this guy, let me know first thing, okay?"
msgstr "Aun si tuvieras tiempo, no irías a clases. Escucha,\\r\nnecesito que me hagas un favor.\\r\n¿Podrías avisarme si ves a este tipo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Volcano Staff"
msgid "Ha! What the heck is this?"
msgstr "Ahh! ¿Que demonios es eso?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Akiyama"
msgid "I'd like to meet with him if possible. Got some business to discuss."
msgstr "Tengo asuntos pendientes que discutir con él."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Volcano Staff"
msgid "And you think you're gonna find him with this? Whatever. If I\\r\nsee anybody who looks even remotely like this, I'll let you know."
msgstr "¿Y crees que vas a encontrarlo con esto? Como sea.\\r\nSi veo a alguien que mas o menos se parezca, te lo haré saber."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Akiyama"
msgid "Thanks. I appreciate it."
msgstr "Gracias. Te lo agradezco."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Akiyama"
msgid "(I ought to show this flyer to the homeless guys on Park Boulevard. They've got a network all their own.)"
msgstr "(Debería enseñarle el boceto a los vagabundos del Parque Boulevard. Tienen una red de inteligencia.)"

